    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "**DNG 3D VIRTUAL TOUR & VIDEO OF THIS PROPERTY AVAILABLE** \r\n\r\nDNG are delighted to present to the market 50 Village Court, Butterfield Avenue, Rathfarnham, Dublin 14. \r\n\r\nSituated on the top floor of this well-established development in Rathfarnham Village, this truly unique two-bedroom penthouse apartment offers a wonderful blend of space, light, and character, with an enviable elevated position and superb views towards the Dublin Mountains. The property benefits from a particularly distinctive top-floor layout, with impressive, vaulted ceilings, excellent natural light, and generous proportions throughout. Beautifully presented and exceptionally well maintained by the current owners, the apartment also benefits from two private balconies, both enjoying a favourable south/westerly aspect and taking full advantage of the stunning views towards the Dublin Mountains.\r\n\r\nPresented in excellent condition throughout, this is a wonderfully distinctive apartment that offers something quite different from the conventional apartment layout and is sure to appeal to those seeking a home with genuine character, excellent natural light and an exceptional sense of privacy and space. \r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises an entrance hall with hot press off, leading into a spacious living/dining room with direct access, via sliding doors, to one of the two balconies. The living area leads through to a fully fitted kitchen. There is a large double bedroom with built-in wardrobes, an ensuite bathroom and sliding doors providing direct access to the other balcony. A second double bedroom, also with built-in wardrobes, and a family bathroom complete the accommodation. \r\n\r\nSituated in the heart of Rathfarnham village, Village Court is within a stone's throw of every conceivable amenity. Rathfarnham Castle Park, with its attractive walks, mature woodland, playgrounds, and tea rooms, which now host regular exhibitions and cultural events, is located across the road, while Bushy Park & St. Enda's Park are also within walking distance. Marlay Park & the Dublin Mountains are a short drive away. Rathfarnham Shopping Centre, Nutgrove Shopping Centre and Dundrum Town Centre are all within a short commute and the property is within the catchment area for some of south Dublin's most highly regarded primary & secondary schools. Terenure Village is within walking distance and there are numerous bus routes on your doorstep providing easy access to the city centre and beyond. For travel further afield, the M50 is a short drive away. \r\n\r\nWith the wild beauty of the Dublin Mountains and the vibrancy of Dublin city both within easy reach, this property offers the best of both worlds, with the city centre and mountain walks, parks and countryside all readily accessible from Rathfarnham Village.\r\n\r\nThis stunning penthouse-style apartment offers its new owner a unique and enviable home in a highly sought-after central location. With its distinctive character, exceptional views and host of appealing features, the property is ideally suited to both owner-occupiers and investors alike.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - 5.71m x 2.85m\r\nWelcoming space with carpet flooring & vaulted ceilings\r\n\r\nLiving/Dining Room - 7.24m x 4.56m\r\nBeautiful open plan, tri aspect space with vaulted ceilings, a floor to ceiling bay window with wonderful and tranquil viewing spot over the local river and villagebox window and sliding doors to south/west facing balcony.\r\n\r\nKitchen - 2.02m x 2.19m\r\nFully fitted kitchen with tiled floor and tiled surround\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 3.48m x 4.56m\r\nVery spacious double bedroom with built-in wardrobes and sliding door to south/west facing balcony.\r\n\r\nEn-suite Bathroom - 1.59m x 2.3\r\nHigh quality fully tiled bathroom suite with WC, WHB & Shower\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 3.92m x 3.57m\r\nVery spacious double bedroom with built-in wardrobes\r\n\r\nBathroom - 3.92m x 3.57m\r\nHigh quality, fully tiled bathroom suite with WC, WHB & bath"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Annual service charge c.1,600</li><li> Truly unique and very spacious, south facing, two-bedroom penthouse apartment.</li><li> Beautifully presented and maintained throughout</li><li> South/west-facing balconies with stunning views of the Dublin Mountains</li><li> Bright and spacious accommodation throughout</li><li> Top-floor apartment with impressive, vaulted ceilings.</li><li> No onward chain</li><li> Secure gated resident parking to the rear of the development</li><li> Located in the heart of Rathfarnham Village</li><li> Newly installed double-glazed windows and French doors to balcony, with key locks</li><li> Well-established and highly regarded development</li><li> Dual-aspect apartment</li><li> Situated adjacent to Rathfarnham Castle</li><li> Within walking distance of both Bushy Park and St. Enda's Park</li><li> Marlay Park and the Dublin Mountains just a short drive away</li><li> Less than a 7-minute drive to Dundrum Town Centre and the Luas</li><li> Excellent access to the M50 and Dublin city centre</li></ul>"
